match-parent; border-color: inherit; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px; padding: 0.5rem; color: #000000; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px 9999px inset;\">Storage</th>\r\n<td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-color: inherit; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px; padding: 0.5rem; color: #000000; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px 9999px inset;\">Store in a cool, dry place or refrigerate</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, NULL, 1, '2026-08-27 16:58:58', '2026-08-30 06:30:54'),
