box-sizing: border-box;\">Supports digestive health</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Great for heart health</li>\r\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">100% organic and pesticide-free\r\n<h5 class=\"mb-3\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.2; font-size: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 1rem !important;\">onal Information</h5>\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" style=\"caption-side: bottom; --bs-table-color-type: initial; --bs-table-bg-type: initial; --bs-table-color-state: initial; --bs-table-bg-state: initial; --bs-table-color: #000; --bs-table-bg: #fff; --bs-table-border-color: #dee2e6; --bs-table-accent-bg: transparent; --bs-table-striped-color: #000; --bs-table-striped-bg: rgba(0,0,0, 0.05); --bs-table-active-color: #000; --bs-table-active-bg: rgba(0,0,0, 0.1); --bs-table-hover-color: #000; --bs-table-hover-bg: rgba(0,0,0, 0.075); width: 1246px; margin-bottom: 1rem; vertical-align: top; border-color: #dee2e6;\">\r\n<tbody style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px; vertical-align: inherit;\">\r\n<tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 0px;\">\r\n<th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: -webkit-match-parent; border-color: inherit; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px; padding: 0.5rem; color: #000000; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px 9999px inset;\" width=\"30%\">Weight</th>\r\n<td style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-color: inherit; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px; padding: 0.5rem; color: #000000; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px 9999px inset;\">1 kg, 2 kg, 5 kg</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 0px;\">\r\n<th style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-align: -webkit-match-parent; border-color: inherit; border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px; padding: 0.5rem; color: #000000; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0) 0px 0px 0px 9999px inset;\">Origin</th>\r\n